# Internal working documents, written to be handed to an implementing model.
# They contain machine-specific details and describe work that may not exist
# yet, so they stay local and are deleted once the work lands.
#
# Nothing durable may live only here. Design rationale belongs in
# docs/design.md, user-facing behaviour in README.md, and changes in
# CHANGELOG.md -- all three are tracked. A rule or decision that exists only
# in an ignored file is one `rm` away from being lost with no history.
*_SPEC.md
docs/superpowers/

# Subagent-driven-development workspace: ledger, task briefs, review packages.
.superpowers/
